":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,65,45,30,35,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13007","armor":"WP1001205","helmet":"WP1024305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1017","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,65,45,30,35,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13007","armor":"WP1001205","helmet":"WP1024305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10074","city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,65,45,30,35,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13007","armor":"WP1001205","helmet":"WP1024305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉末年白波军的首领之一，曾在兴平二年参与了护卫汉献帝东归的行动。生卒年不详。出身白波贼（黄巾余部），与杨奉、韩暹、胡才等齐名。兴平二年，受杨奉密召，率部与李傕、郭汜交战并获胜，护送献帝至河东安邑。因功受封征北将军（一说征西将军）。后与杨奉等策划挟持献帝未果。建安元年，曹操迎献帝都许，李乐留河东，后病逝。","tc":"東漢末年白波軍的首領之一，曾在興平二年參與了護衛漢獻帝東歸的行動。生卒年不詳。出身白波賊（黃巾余部），與楊奉、韓暹、胡才等齊名。興平二年，受楊奉密召，率部與李傕、郭汜交戰并獲勝，護送獻帝至河東安邑。因功受封征北將軍（一說征西將軍）。后與楊奉等策劃挾持獻帝未果。建安元年，曹操迎獻帝都許，李樂留河東，后病逝。","en":"A leader of the White Wave Bandits in the late Eastern Han dynasty who participated in escorting Emperor Xian on his eastward journey in the second year of Xingping (195). His birth and death years are unknown. Originating from the White Wave Bandits (remnants of the Yellow Turbans), he was of equal renown with Yang Feng, Han Xian, and Hu Cai. In the second year of Xingping, secretly summoned by Yang Feng, he led his troops into battle against Li Jue and Guo Si, achieving victory, and escorted Emperor Xian to Anyi in Hedong. For his merit, he was appointed North Off. (conquest) (by another account, West Off. (conquest)). Later, his plot with Yang Feng and others to seize control of Emperor Xian came to nothing. In the first year of Jianan, Cao Cao escorted Emperor Xian to the capital at Xu, Li Yue remained in Hedong, where he later died of illness.","jp":"後漢末期の白波軍の頭領の一人。興平2年に漢の献帝を護衛して東帰させた。生没年不詳。白波賊（黄巾の残党）の出身で、楊奉、韓暹、胡才らと並び称された。興平2年、楊奉の密招を受け、軍を率いて李傕・郭汜と交戦して勝利を収め、献帝を河東の安邑まで護送した。その功により征北将軍（一説には征西将軍）に任じられた。後に楊奉らとともに献帝を手中に収めようと画策するも失敗。建安元年、曹操が献帝を迎えて許に都を定めると、李楽は河東に留まり、後に病没した。","kr":"후한 말 백파군의 수령 중 한 명으로, 흥평 2년에 헌제의 동귀를 호위하는 데 참여했다. 생몰년은 미상이다. 백파적(황건적 잔당) 출신으로 양봉, 한섬, 호재 등과 어깨를 나란히 했다. 흥평 2년, 양봉의 밀명을 받고 군사를 이끌어 이각, 곽사와 교전하여 승리를 거두었으며, 헌제를 하동 안읍까지 호위했다. 그 공으로 정북장군(일설에는 정서장군)에 봉해졌다. 이후 양봉 등과 함께 헌제를 억류하려 획책했으나 미수에 그쳤다. 건안 원년, 조조가 헌제를 맞이하여 허도에 도읍을 정하자 이락은 하동에 남았다가 훗날 병사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1051315","remark":"普武","surname":"李","surnameTc":"李","surnameEn":"Li","surnameJp":"李","surnameKr":"이","surnameOther":"","name":"乐","nameTc":"樂","nameEn":"Le","nameJp":"楽","nameKr":"악","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"李乐","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1017","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"65","wise":"45","politics":"30","charm":"35","will":"60","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"1","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"32/65/30/35/36/35/37/31","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1013005","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4900","battleSoulPoint":"6700","debateSoulPoint":"100","strategy":"1010915","strategy2":"1000905","professions":"0/2/3/0/2/0/2/0/0/0/1/1/2/0/2/2/0/0/0/0/0/1/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morali